+# NOTE-1: Show the word count of each note
+
+## Definition of Ready
+Problem: A writer cannot see how long a note is in the list.
+Acceptance criteria:
+- Notes.list() adds " [N]" to the end of each line. N is len(text.split()).
+- For the notes "buy milk" and "", Notes.list() returns ["1. buy milk [2]", "2.  [0]"].
+Non-goals: No count of characters. No change to Notes.add().
+Test oracle: A unit test adds "buy milk" and "" and compares Notes.list() with the list above.
+Personas: writer
